      {
        "lamp": "light_breake",
        "measured": "the inward offset collapses at 2-5 mm (median wall 0.80-0.92 mm against a 2-5 mm offset, 35-175 self-intersecting face pairs) and is not a valid closed manifold at 6-12 mm; usable x span 0.0 m at every offset",
        "consequence": "no internal guide; the brake light is lit by material/emission on the lens. This is an optical VISUAL_APPROXIMATION, not proven OEM-exact segmentation."
